      Mueller). Chosen by measurement, not by preference: with

      Gardner''s detector this chain did not lock at all - the

      recovered magnitudes had a spread of 0.30 against 0.002

      for this one, and EVM sat near 45% on a noiseless signal.

      The cost is that it IS decision-directed, which is why

      this receiver is a QPSK receiver - see the note.'
